the-firm-as-one-program-35 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-35 = unlines (cons "- **C12** The provenance of every running byte is known ([P9: Content-addressed, decentralized exchange of code with its proofs (hyperactivity v31 §10.8)])." (cons "  Every definition is identified by content, every change is a new object with its author and rationale, and nothing is overwritten. An unauthorized change is a different identity that cannot silently replace the approved one, so the integrity of the firm's code against insiders and compromised dependencies becomes a property it can check." nil))
